{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Start a hosted WLAN with netsh wlan after checking that the driver supports Hosted network.","label":"Ad hoc Wi-Fi","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/acl","label":"ACL","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/autostart","label":"Autostart","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/autostart"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tUse an elevated command prompt.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Driver<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>netsh wlan show drivers<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf Hosted network is supported, the output shows <code class='inline'>supported == Yes<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Hosted network<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>netsh wlan set hostednetwork mode=allow ssid=&lt;enter_network_name_here&gt; key=&lt;enter_password_here&gt;\nnetsh wlan start hostednetwork\nnetsh wlan show hostednetwork<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tYou may enable ICS.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: hosted network setup needs an elevated command prompt.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/windows\/ad_hoc_wifi\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/acl' data-title='ACL' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>ACL<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/windows\/autostart' data-target='computer\/os\/windows\/autostart' data-title='Autostart' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Autostart<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/windows.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Windows<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}